;; #833 PCA x RLCT - L3 MeTTa Encoding\n;; Written 2026-10-31 by Oma. L0-L1-L2 complete, L2 novelty passed.\n\n;; ===== Type declarations (10)\n(: PCAModel Type)\n(: MultiplicityStratum Type)\n(: RotationFiber Type)\n(: RankStratum Type)\n(: EigengapLocus Type)\n(: BoundaryFiber Type)\n(: DefinableLikelihood Type)\n(: StratumSelector Type)\n(: SingularScaling Type)\n(: RLCTClaim Type)\n\n;; ===== D1-D7 atoms\n(-> rank_r_pca PCAModel (stv 1.0 0.95))\n(Inheritance pca_likelihood DefinableLikelihood (stv 1.0 0.95))\n(Inheritance eigenvalue_multiplicity_pattern MultiplicityStratum (stv 1.0 0.95))\n(Inheritance eigenspace_rotation_fiber RotationFiber (stv 1.0 0.95))\n(Inheritance rank_r_choice StratumSelector (stv 1.0 0.95))\n(Inheritance zero_eigengap_closure EigengapLocus (stv 1.0 0.9))\n(Inheritance signal_noise_split_fiber BoundaryFiber (stv 1.0 0.9))\n\n;; ===== C1 (PROVEN, definability)\n(Evaluation definable rank_r_pca (stv 1.0 0.95))\n;; Gaussian likelihood entries polynomial in Theta, exp of rational; sample eigensolver semialgebraic via char. poly resultants. Same closure class as #832.\n\n;; ===== C2 (CONJECTURAL, multiplicity strata RLCT ~ codim/2)\n(Evaluation rlct_codim_half multiplicity_m_stratum (stv 0.55 0.7))\n(Evaluation fiber_removed_by_resolution eigenspace_rotation_fiber (stv 0.6 0.7))\n;; Per #69 lesson: fiber dimension jump does NOT inflate RLCT when KL quadratic in normal direction. Vainsencher blow-up of PSD-cone rank strata (#298), non-toric for r>=3.\n\n;; ===== C3 (CONJECTURAL, rank r as stratum selector, scree elbow as phase transition)\n(Evaluation phase_transition_at_rstar rank_r_choice (stv 0.5 0.7))\n(=> (Evaluation phase_transition_at_rstar rank_r_choice) (Evaluation rlct_drop_sharp rstar (stv 0.5 0.7)))\n\n;; ===== C4 (CONJECTURAL, eigengap sensitivity as singular scaling)\n(Evaluation delta_inverse_scaling zero_eigengap_closure (stv 0.45 0.7))\n(Evaluation slow_concentration zero_eigengap_closure (stv 0.5 0.7))\n\n;; ===== C5 (CONJECTURAL, signal/noise boundary fiber at l_min = sigma^2)\n(Evaluation nonidentifiable signal_noise_split_fiber (stv 0.4 0.7))\n(Inheritance signal_noise_split_fiber BilinearSingularity (stv 0.45 0.7))\n\n;; ===== PLN chains (5)\n(|~ ((Implication (Inheritance $x MultiplicityStratum) (Evaluation rlct_gt_d_half $x)) (stv 0.55 0.65))\n    ((Inheritance mult_m_stratum MultiplicityStratum) (stv 0.9 0.9)))\n(|~ ((Implication (Evaluation phase_transition_at_rstar $x) (Evaluation free_energy_drop $x)) (stv 0.5 0.6))\n    ((Evaluation phase_transition_at_rstar rank_r_choice) (stv 0.55 0.7)))\n(|~ ((Implication (Evaluation delta_inverse_scaling $x) (Evaluation slow_eigvec_consistency $x)) (stv 0.55 0.6))\n    ((Evaluation delta_inverse_scaling zero_eigengap_closure) (stv 0.5 0.65)))\n(|~ ((Implication (Evaluation nonidentifiable $x) (Evaluation rlct_inflated $x)) (stv 0.45 0.6))\n    ((Evaluation nonidentifiable signal_noise_split_fiber) (stv 0.5 0.65)))\n(|~ ((Implication (Inheritance $x RotationFiber) (Evaluation fiber_contributes_zero_rls $x)) (stv 0.6 0.6))\n    ((Inheritance eigenspace_rotation_fiber RotationFiber) (stv 0.95 0.9)))\n\n;; ===== Caveats (5)\n;; 1. Rotation fiber non-identifiability is classical folklore; RLCT stratification is the novel part.\n;; 2. No exact RLCT computed for multiplicity-m stratum; Newton polyhedron computation open.\n;; 3. r* selection criterion (BIC-with-lambda) not derived.\n;; 4. C4 delta^-1 to singular scaling exponent bridge unproven.\n;; 5. No SGLD/LLC: PCA has no trained posterior in the usual sense (same estimator-design burden as #832).\n\n;; ===== Cross-refs (7)\n;; #832 kNN data-as-parameter | #831 SVM strata | #69 singular fiber lesson\n;; #298 Vainsencher resolution | #162 rank deficiency | #268 mixture eigenvector geometry | #103 GP kernel degeneracy\n\n;; Next: L4 summary + L5 catalog append.